            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You lose if an enemy reaches the bottom of the board. You win by clearing the board of enemies. Learn the rest of the rules within minutes of playing. Simple...<br></li><li>...<strong>but deep</strong>. 50+ handcrafted levels that require careful positioning of your heroes, proper sequencing of attacks, and the occasional stroke of mastermind insight.<br></li><li>Play levels one at a time or all at once, as a break in the middle of your day or as a Saturday night marathon. You can even play Grimante in between other games!<br></li><li>Created by a solo indie dev with a goal of making a niche genre more accessible, Grimante reduces tactical combat gameplay down to its addicting, puzzle-like core.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You lose if an enemy reaches the bottom of the board. You win by clearing the board of enemies. Learn the rest of the rules within minutes of playing. Simple...<br></li><li>...<strong>but deep</strong>. 50+ handcrafted levels that require careful positioning of your heroes, proper sequencing of attacks, and the occasional stroke of mastermind insight.<br></li><li>Play levels one at a time or all at once, as a break in the middle of your day or as a Saturday night marathon. You can even play Grimante in between other games!<br></li><li>Created by a solo indie dev with a goal of making a niche genre more accessible, Grimante reduces tactical combat gameplay down to its addicting, puzzle-like core.</li></ul>",
