                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very fun game and mildly addicting. I usually don't enjoy turn-based strategy games, but this one presents tough problems while also allowing the player to find multiple creative solutions, which I appreciated very much. The attributes of each hero/enemy make for unique problems each time and for equally satisfying wins. I've played through a little less than half of the puzzles, but I find myself going back to try to get 5 stars on all of them. Neat game and appealing to those looking for a relaxed puzzle game or for a challenging strategy game.",
